flowchart TB
    RECORD["Customer, case, document, or order<br/>one saved item in the product"]
    OWNER["Owner<br/>the person responsible for this item"]
    SHARED["Shared team<br/>the people invited to work with this item"]
    MEMBER["Team member<br/>a person in the shared team"]
    PUBLIC["Public visitor<br/>anyone browsing the product"]
    ADMIN["Administrator<br/>a person trusted to manage every item"]
    GRANT["Who can do what<br/>find, view, add, change, remove, use, or connect"]

    RECORD -->|is owned by| OWNER
    RECORD -->|can be shared with| SHARED
    MEMBER -->|belongs to| SHARED
    RECORD -->|records| GRANT
    GRANT -->|sets what the owner can do| OWNER
    GRANT -->|sets what team members can do| MEMBER
    GRANT -->|sets what visitors can do| PUBLIC
    ADMIN -->|can manage every| RECORD

    classDef record fill:#ECFDF5,stroke:#10B981,color:#064E3B,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef audience fill:#EEF2FF,stroke:#6366F1,color:#1E1B4B,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef access fill:#FFF7ED,stroke:#F59E0B,color:#7C2D12,stroke-width:2px;
    class RECORD record;
    class OWNER,SHARED,MEMBER,PUBLIC,ADMIN audience;
    class GRANT access;
